# GameDayOps College — production Supabase target.
#
# The project URL is baked in here so the College build ALWAYS talks to the
# correct Supabase project (the one that holds the multi-tenant schema, auth,
# and the bootstrap_org function) regardless of Vercel env-var state. The URL is
# not a secret — it is just the project's public address.
#
# The publishable (anon) key is NOT committed. Set it in Vercel:
#   Vercel → College project → Settings → Environment Variables
#   Key:   VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY
#   Value: the Supabase "Publishable key" (sb_publishable_...) from
#          Supabase → Project Settings → API Keys. NEVER the sb_secret_ key.
# A Vercel value overrides this file; if it is unset, the build fails safely to
# local mode rather than talking to the wrong project.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://wwpwjfrywzmmbjintgp.supabase.co
